    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With the blue, purple, and red wool they made the magnificent garments which the priests were to wear when they served in the Holy Place. They made the priestly garments for Aaron, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made the ephod of fine linen; blue, purple, and red wool; and gold thread. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They hammered out sheets of gold and cut them into thin strips to be worked into the fine linen and into the blue, purple, and red wool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made two shoulder straps for the ephod and attached them to its sides, so that it could be fastened. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The finely woven belt, made of the same materials, was attached to the ephod so as to form one piece with it, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They prepared the carnelians and mounted them in gold settings; they were skilfully engraved with the names of the twelve sons of Jacob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They put them on the shoulder straps of the ephod to represent the twelve tribes of Israel, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made the breastpiece of the same materials as the ephod and with similar embroidery. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was square and folded double, 22 centimetres long and 22 centimetres wide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They mounted four rows of precious stones on it: in the first row they mounted a ruby, a topaz, and a garnet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the second row, an emerald, a sapphire, and a diamond; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the third row, a turquoise, an agate, and an amethyst; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and in the fourth row, a beryl, a carnelian, and a jasper. These were mounted in gold settings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each of the twelve stones had engraved on it the name of one of the sons of Jacob, in order to represent the twelve tribes of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the breastpiece they made chains of pure gold, twisted like cords. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made two gold settings and two gold rings and attached the two rings to the upper corners of the breastpiece. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They fastened the two gold cords to the two rings ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and fastened the other two ends of the cords to the two settings and in this way attached them in front to the shoulder straps of the ephod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made two rings of gold and attached them to the lower corners of the breastpiece, on the inside edge next to the ephod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made two more gold rings and attached them to the lower part of the front of the two shoulder straps of the ephod, near the seam and above the finely woven belt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses, they tied the rings of the breastpiece to the rings of the ephod with a blue cord, so that the breastpiece rested above the belt and did not come loose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The robe that goes under the ephod was made entirely of blue wool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The hole for the head was reinforced with a woven binding to keep it from tearing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All round its lower hem they put pomegranates of fine linen and of blue, purple, and red wool, alternating with bells of pure gold, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.24+EXO.39.25+EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.24",
              "EXO.39.25",
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.24+EXO.39.25+EXO.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.24",
              "EXO.39.25",
              "EXO.39.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
