            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made the shirts for Aaron and his sons, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the turban, the caps, the linen shorts, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the sash of fine linen and of blue, purple, and red wool, decorated with embroidery, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made the ornament, the sacred sign of dedication, out of pure gold, and they engraved on it “Dedicated to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They tied it to the front of the turban with a blue cord, just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
